        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWg_bWPh4RrA3JM8GKYsz1bM_t2d8QQLf3HENKqnJmWZ0nROMsL=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "*edited:\nThis has been my long time veterinary clinic for generations of my cats, and they've always been great for mundane services, be it an annual check-up, treatment of seasonal allergies, or monthly weigh-ins for weight-control.  Following a recent emergency that required immediate and ongoing medical care, the team at Anima Plus have demonstrated a clear interest and ability to act in Peppers best interest and do what it takes to get her on the mend and healed.",
        "time": 1671372878,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Charles Legault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106735257953288341751/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWVGCTLRRiitS7YclCHN9Ipgl6A0OVJM2uS6RuX5z-7wsZMIZ-3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "The staff took us in at the last minute and saved our little fur baby's life!\n\nThey took excellent care of our cat Flora and even called a few times to follow up on her condition after we left. These are professionals that truly care about animals and my wife and I are thankful for their intervention.\n\nHighly recommended!",
        "time": 1748467894,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Steven Enslow",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114851162882040971958/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJDy7EVvRK-mfze1KWiFGgJSkDn6rUUQYZXhH9rBMbLsGFRdQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "We have been using the vet since 2008, they have been excellent in looking after our dogs. Currently we have 2 English Bulldogs and it’s reassuring to know the vet is knowledgeable in this breed.",
        "time": 1755116383,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lisa & Matt Gonder",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117436615086447673327/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7jcOYewkSYK1vAcFIGn_NUHJQ0OK9C0h4Xzgwjr0LfCWeeko_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "My feline Sam has been very sick for some time and we took him on our travels this time. I need to see a vet quickly and this clinic made time for us. The staff was just amazing and the Dr. Boisselle was extremely knowledgeable and super caring.  Totally recommend this clinic. I will definately be back and will recommend this clinic to all my family and friends in the area.\n\nTo the Dr and Staff, Thank you again 🙏",
        "time": 1695820074,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chrystal Cobham",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112505961542036125010/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlNHfC4ez6c4GFzQNvAmhFNJNUqkbdfDlNJcLouKjIVHv0JIZj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I have nothing but amazing things to say! I never usually leave reviews, however I am just so so happy with overall the whole team at anima plus and wow I have never met a better Dr than Jean- Marc!! Not only is he so relatable, he really is so empathetic and gives the time to listen. He has now seen 4 of my fur babies over the years, which include 3 different species (1 exotic even) and was able to diagnose an issue within a few minutes after I had already spent over 2k at a vet with zero answers. I will now be only going to see him! Thank you Anima-Plus.",
        "time": 1746919657,
        "translated": false
      }
